utdown speed and corrected the taskbar icon. Limited character resizing to prevent excessively large or small sizes. Fixed Settings display, pet right-click resizing, and house tutorial issues. Adjusted dialogue and Nuwa entrance music volume and completed missing translations. Thanks for your feedback!","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-21T14:49:28Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1847286114029101","verified_at":"2026-10-21T17:32:23Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4302800-1847286114027639","game_id":"steam-4302800","kind":"announcement","title":"Demo 20261021: Meet your first Tuanbot with Huahua!","summary":"Hello! The new Tuanbot Demo is live. Join Huahua to plant a tree, discover the main menu and meet Nuwa, who will help you create your first Tuanbot. Give it a name and visit its new home! New interactive onboarding: meet your desktop companions and discover features through short conversations and interactions. Create your own companions: there is no pre-made starter Tuanbot. All 3 Demo creation slots are yours to use. More desktop controls: right-click to resize Tuanbots and NPCs. Huahua, Nuwa,","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-21T05:48:20Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1847286114027639","verified_at":"2026-10-21T12:13:18Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4302800-1846651706689109","game_id":"steam-4302800","kind":"announcement","title":"The new TuanBot demo is here! Meet your little desktop companions","summary":"Hi everyone! I’m Hou Xiaohou, the solo developer of TuanBot. What if a few little companions lived their own lives inside your computer? While you’re busy, they wander around your desktop, head back to Tuantuan House to rest, and share little stories with each other. When you take a break, you can see what they’re up to—or ask Feihuahua, the talkative flower, to gather everyone together. That’s the world I’m building with TuanBot. The new free demo is now available. Come meet your little compani","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-19T07:30:54Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706689109","verified_at":"2026-10-20T13:42:19Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"}],"analyses":[],"news_status":{"steam-4302800":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T02:09:59Z","status":"ok","all_sources_checked_at":"2026-10-26T02:09:59Z","error_codes":[]}},"news_last_attempt_at":{"steam-4302800":"2026-10-26T02:09:59Z"},"notices":[],"news_sources":{"4302800":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T02:09:59Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T02:09:59Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[]},"4634310":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T02:09:59Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T02:09:59Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[]}},"context_snapshots":[{"schema_version":1,"game_id":"steam-4302800","app_id":4302800,"app_scope":"base","observed_at":"2026-10-26T06:14:33Z","source_url":"https://api.steampowered.com/IStoreBrowseService/GetItems/v1/","context":{"country":"KR","language":"koreana","batch_size":100},"status":"ok","error_code":null,"store_item_success":1,"raw_item_sha256":"2b65f05848afe03ed17e9836ee0f9b29948d18d163012a41e0fed773573a21b1","response_sha256":null,"source_fields":{"basic_info":{"short_description":"나만의 데스크톱 친구를 만들고, Tuan House의 소소한 이야기를 발견하고, 수다쟁이 꽃 Feihuahua와 함께하세요. 지원되는 Agent 도구를 연결해 사용 한도를 확인하고 계정을 관리할 수도 있습니다. 무료 TuanBot 데모에서는 최대 3명의 친구를 보유할 수 있으며 AI 채팅은 제공하지 않습니다.","publishers":[{"name":"Hou Xiaohou","creator_clan_account_id":45642571}],"developers":[{"name":"Hou Xiaohou","creator_clan_account_id":45642571}]},"release":{"is_coming_soon":true,"custom_release_date_message":"출시 예정","coming_soon_display